    "description": "Item Description\nFor your consideration is a classic pair of vintage short baluster-style candlesticks. Featuring an elegant, low-profile silhouette with wide, stable bases, these timeless pieces offer a traditional aesthetic that complements any dining table, mantle, or holiday display.\nProduct Details\nMaterial: Sterling Silver (Weighted base for stability)\nQuantity: Matching pair (2 pieces)\nStyle: Mid-Century Modern / Traditional Baluster\nMaker/Hallmarks: Marked on the underside\nCondition Report\nThese candlesticks are in authentic vintage condition with a beautiful, natural aged patina and visible tarnishing throughout. We have left them unpolished so the buyer can choose whether to preserve the historic character or polish them to a bright shine. There are no major structural dents, though minor surface wear and light scuffs consistent with age and careful use are present. Please review all high-resolution photos closely as they form part of the cosmetic description.",
